# rmgr.manifest — TSR-RMGR-001 expected host resource managers / bring-up
# services that must report successful arming before guest auto-start.
#
# Phase 1 (study-level). One entry per line; '#' comments and blank lines
# ignored. Each entry is the start-marker token the QHV host startup emits
# (matched against the boot log's "---> Starting <X>" lines). The verifier
# asserts each manifested rmgr both STARTED and did not subsequently report
# an arm failure ("Failed to arm a resource manager").
#
# Tokens match the host-side startup section of the boot log (above the
# "===== guest booting inside qvm =====" split).
#
# Field 1: rmgr token (substring of the host startup line)

slogger2
PCI Services
fsevmgr
Networking
sshd
